# 10 - Backend / RAG Rule

Áp dụng khi task liên quan backend, RAG, upload tài liệu, parsing, chunking, embedding, retrieval, chat sync, chat streaming, security hoặc service Java.

## Package map (canonical sau 25D)

| Concern | Package / class |
|---|---|
| Parse / raw tables | `ingest.parser.DocumentParserService`, `RawTableModel` |
| Table normalization | `ingest.normalize.NormalizedTableService` |
| Chunking | `ingest.chunking.ChunkingService2` |
| Embed + Qdrant REST I/O | `index.embedding.EmbeddingService` |
| Qdrant bootstrap / purge | `index.qdrant.QdrantConfig`, `QdrantPurgeService` |
| Retrieval | `rag.retrieve.RagRetrievalService`, `KeywordSearchService` |
| Prompt | `rag.prompt.PromptBuilderService` |
| Query analysis | `rag.analysis.QueryAnalyzerService`, `QuerySignalExtractor` |
| Rerank | `rag.rerank.RerankService` |
| Context budget | `rag.budget.PromptBudgetResolver` |
| Chat runtime | `rag.runtime.ChatService`, `PlaygroundService` |
| Audit metrics | `audit.metrics.RagTokenAudit`, `RagLatencyTrace` |
| LLM adapter | `llm.LlmFallbackService`, `LlmGenerationOptions` |
| Upload / admin | `service.DocumentService`, `WidgetService` |

**Không** tìm RAG core trong `service.*` (đã chuyển 25B–25D).

## Qdrant / DOCX / Unicode (bắt buộc nhớ)

- **Qdrant write path**: REST upsert/search qua `index.embedding.EmbeddingService` (Spring `RestClient` + Jackson UTF-8 JSON).
- **Không** dùng LangChain4j `QdrantEmbeddingStore` / gRPC write path (đã gỡ 24D4/25A).
- **DOCX tables**: logical-grid `RawTableModel`; value-to-slot mapping dùng `physicalColIndex` (DOCX) hoặc x-overlap (PDF Tabula).
- **Qdrant payload**: giữ UTF-8 Vietnamese Unicode trong `cells_json`, `text_segment`, v.v.
- **Ingest chunk types mới**: `normalized_table_row` + `table_summary`; không tạo `table_row_group` / `text_table_like` trên ingest mới.

